{"info": {"address1": "Fortune House", "address2": "Near Navrangpura Railway Crossing", "city": "Ahmedabad", "zip": "380009", "country": "India", "phone": "91 79 2645 5650", "fax": "91 79 2645 5621", "website": "https://www.awl.in", "industry": "Packaged Foods", "industryKey": "packaged-foods", "industryDisp": "Packaged Foods", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "AWL Agri Business Limited, a fast-moving consumer goods food company, provides kitchen commodities in India and internationally. It operates through Edible Oils, Food & FMCG, and Industry Essentials segments. The company offers soyabean, palm, sunflower, rice bran, mustard, groundnut, cottonseed, and blended oil; specialty fats, including industrial margarine, bakery shortenings, and vanaspati for baked products; and lauric fats as substitutes for milk fat and cocoa butter substitutes for ice cream and confectionery. It also provides oleochemicals, such as stearic acids, soap noodles, palmitic acids, oleic acids, and glycerin for home and personal care products; castor oils and its derivatives comprising steric acids and ricin oleic acids for medical, pharmaceutical, cosmetic, and aeronautical use; and de-oiled cakes that are used as livestock feeds. In addition, the company offers wheat flour, rice, pulses, sugar, besan, poha, rawa, suji, soya chunks, sattu, soya flour, soya grits, soya flakes, and soya bari; and soaps, handwash, and sanitizers. Further, it is involved in packaging of frying oil. The company provides its products under the Fortune, King's, Aadhar, Bullet, Raag, Alpha, Jubilee, Avsar, Golden Chef, Fryola, Kohinoor, Charminar, Trophy, and Alife brand names, as well as e-commerce channels. The company was formerly known as Adani Wilmar Limited and changed its name to AWL Agri Business Limited in March 2025. AWL Agri Business Limited was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India. As on November 19, 2025, AWL Agri Business Limited operates as a subsidiary to Lence Pte. Ltd.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Shrikant  Kanhere", "title": "MD & CEO", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 23000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Angshu  Mallick", "age": 64, "title": "Executive Deputy Chairman", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 59000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ravindra Kumar Singh", "age": 58, "title": "Head of Technical & Operations and Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 24900000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Darshil Mayank Lakhia", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3600000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pankaj  Goyal", "title": "Interim Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Saumin Champaklal Sheth", "title": "COO & Executive Director", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Venkata Rao Damera", "age": 52, "title": "Chief Information Officer & Digital Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Abhik  Das", "title": "Head of Investor Relations & M&A", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mukesh Kumar Mishra", "title": "Joint President of Sales and Marketing", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Siddhartha  Ghosh", "title": "Chief Human Resource Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 2, "previousClose": 195.14, "open": 197.99, "d